{"words": [{"text": "وَلِلَّهِ", "translation": "And for Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَشْرِقُ", "translation": "(is) the east"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَغْرِبُ ۚ", "translation": "and the west"}, {"text": "فَأَيْنَمَا", "translation": "so wherever"}, {"text": "تُوَلُّوا۟", "translation": "you turn"}, {"text": "فَثَمَّ", "translation": "[so] there"}, {"text": "وَجْهُ", "translation": "(is the) face"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۚ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَٰسِعٌ", "translation": "(is) All-Encompassing"}, {"text": "عَلِيمٌۭ", "translation": "All-Knowing"}], "sahih": "And to Allāh belongs the east and the west. So wherever you [might] turn, there is the Face1 of Allāh. Indeed, Allāh is all-Encompassing and Knowing."}